(text "IMU cable and exact received board revisions are unverified physical assemblies; E3 now defines\nRP2040-Zero/BNO085 internal wiring.\nВорота (стенд): Verify E3 board-pad map on received revisions; confirm chosen GX16 harness orientation, 3.3V\nUART and diode-fed E5_IMU_VIN; run 1e6 CRC-clean frames and 100 cold starts." (at 13.97 257.83 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 7bffe5fe-0014-5fd7-88f8-f313bfcd10cb))
